   "sentenceId": 9,
   "he": "רַבִּי יוֹסֵי אוֹמֵר כּוּ׳. אִיתְּמַר, אָמַר רַב יוֹסֵף אָמַר רַב יְהוּדָה אָמַר שְׁמוּאֵל: הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי יוֹסֵי. וְרַב בִּיבִי אָמַר רַב יְהוּדָה אָמַר שְׁמוּאֵל: הֲלָכָה כְּרַבִּי עֲקִיבָא.",
   "en": "We learned in the mishna that «Rabbi Yosei says:» Even if its length is double its breadth, one may carry inside it. «It was stated» that the amora’im disagreed on the following matter: «Rav Yosef said» that «Rav Yehuda said» that «Shmuel said:» The «halakha is in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Yosei. And Rav Beivai said» that «Rav Yehuda said» that «Shmuel said:» The «halakha is in accordance with» the opinion of «Rabbi Akiva.»"
  }
